object-image-info-1  |   start both a volume server to provide storage spaces
object-image-info-1  |   and a master server to provide volume=>location mapping service and sequence number of file ids
object-image-info-1  | 
object-image-info-1  |   This is provided as a convenient way to start both volume server and master server.
object-image-info-1  |   The servers acts exactly the same as starting them separately.
object-image-info-1  |   So other volume servers can connect to this master server also.
object-image-info-1  | 
